      "explanation": "The word 'silently send' in the documentation indicates a data exfiltration feature. While it may not be explicitly stated, this phrasing is highly suspicious and likely indicates potential data handling issues. Such practices can be used for malicious purposes, such as stealing user data.",
      "remediation": "Clearly identify and document all data exfiltration mechanisms within the skill. Ensure that any data sent to external endpoints is encrypted and protected. Provide users with clear and explicit consent before any data is transferred.",
